<title>MOLDOVA: TABLE-MOLDOVAN LEU EDGES DOWN TO 4.5705 PER DOLLAR.</title>
<headline>TABLE-MOLDOVAN LEU EDGES DOWN TO 4.5705 PER DOLLAR.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moldovan leu edged down to</p>
<p>4.5705 to the dollar on the Moldovan Interbank Currency</p>
<p>Exchange from 4.5675 on Aug 1.</p>
<p>				   Aug 12     Aug 11</p>
<p> lei per dollar		4.5705     4.5675</p>
<p> volume traded ($)	   200,000    200,000</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
